@startuml F3.4-ERRO-a-token-ja-utilizado
title F3.4-ERRO-a — Deep-link com token já utilizado
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: abre deep-link reusado
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /requests/{id}\n+ deepLinkToken
Jwt -> Ctrl: sessão ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: JTI na blacklist?
Postgres --> Ctrl: sim
Ctrl --> WebApp: 401 token_already_used
note right of Ctrl
  401 (token inválido),
  não 403 de authority
end note
WebApp --> Prof: EmptyState → fila

@enduml
